While Electrosurge is active, randomly uses one of the following attacks at intervals of {0}s:
1. Thundercloud Strike: Deals Electro DMG to opponents within the AoE, and the active character gains {1} Elemental Energy;
2. Thundercloud Rainstorm: Deals Hydro DMG to opponents within the AoE, and the active character is healed for {2}% HP

